\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Rejoice the Lord is King
\par Your Lord and King adore;
\par Mortals, give thanks, and sing,
\par And triumph evermore
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0\i 
\par Lift up your heart, lift up your voice;
\par Rejoice, again I say, Rejoice.
\par \i0 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Jesus the Saviour reigns,
\par The God of truth and love;
\par When He had purged our stains,
\par He took His seat above
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0\i 
\par Lift up your heart, lift up your voice;
\par Rejoice, again I say, Rejoice.
\par \i0 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. His kingdom cannot fail,
\par He rules o'er earth and heaven;
\par The keys of death and hell,
\par Are to our Jesus given
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0\i 
\par Lift up your heart, lift up your voice;
\par Rejoice, again I say, Rejoice.
\par \i0 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. He sits at Gods right hand,
\par Till all His foes submit,
\par And bow to His command,
\par And fall beneath His feet
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0\i 
\par Lift up your heart, lift up your voice;
\par Rejoice, again I say, Rejoice.
\par \i0 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. He all His foes shall quell,
\par Shall all our sins destroy,
\par And every bosom swell
\par With pure seraphic joy
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0\i 
\par Lift up your heart, lift up your voice;
\par Rejoice, again I say, Rejoice.
\par \i0 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. Rejoice in glorious hope;
\par Jesus the Judge shall come,
\par And take His servant up
\par To their eternal home
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0\i 
\par We soon shall hear the archangel's voice
\par The trump of God shall sound, Rejoice!
\par 
\par \i0 
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f1 
\par \f2 
\par }

